:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Wrestling Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Maiden Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Teacher! It's Spring! (Monthly Event)|Teacher! It's Spring!]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. This unit is a variant of [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] with barely lowered stats and cost, a slightly higher range and attack animation as well as the [[Strong Against|Strong]] against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies [[Special Abilities|ability]]. [[True Form]] greatly increases her health and gains [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it was made available in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|stage 48]] in Chapter 1.

