==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sportsgirl Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Wrestling Cat''' when obtained from [[Maiden Awakes!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Maiden Cat acts as a 4-Crown replacement of or secondary [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], with slightly slower attack speed and an [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] ability. Maiden Cat is also included in [[Seasons of Love (Combo)|Seasons of Love]] and [[Sportswoman (Combo)|Sportswoman]], two very useful [[Cat Combo]]s. However, her very low stats often do not make her any better than other alternatives as attackers outside of early game.

==='''True Form'''===
Wrestling Cat gains freeze immunity and greatly increased health. She can now be used against [[Dark Emperor Santa]] or [[CTO Seal]], and can tank more enemy attacks. The stat bonuses, despite giving her better health than Jamiera Cat against reds at the same level, do not offset her weaknesses though, as Jamiera Cat's level can go above 50, so her use as a combo unit remains unchanged.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Combo Slave}}

